<title>SINGAPORE: Aztech Systems dips to 1996 net loss.</title>
<headline>Aztech Systems dips to 1996 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			     12.47   vs	25.30</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  (loss) 3.46   vs	 7.03</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted  (loss) 3.41   vs	 6.98</p>
<p>(profit)</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		  4.00   vs	30.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			    425.89   vs     662.15</p>
<p>    Other income incl interest	1.67   vs	 0.85</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		  7.92   vs	 5.04</p>
